  "description": "Hae-il and Hyun grew up together like brothers in an orphanage. However, from a certain day onwards, Hyun began to be tormented by a strange desire to violate Hae-il every night; strangely enough, come morning, he could not recall any of it.\n\nIn search of the cause, Hae-il seeks out Sawol, a nine-tailed fox shaman who has lived for 300 years. The moment he sees Hae-il, Sawol instinctively realises that he is the ‘divine object’ that will alleviate his curse...\n\n*“I will give you what you need, so you must give me what I want.”* *(Source: Bomtoon, translated)*\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/howoldang)",
